# Vendored skills: every `.claude/skills/<name>/` whose name is a key in skills-lock.json.
# Reformatting one drifts the file from its recorded hash. The four repo-authored skills
# below are re-included so their prose stays Prettier-checked. Add a directory here when
# you vendor a skill, and remove it when you prune one.
.claude/skills/*/
!.claude/skills/archon/
!.claude/skills/new-plugin/
!.claude/skills/night-shift/
!.claude/skills/verify-spec/
